# What the agent is writing, as it writes it.
title The live changes pane
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
pre lmux create . --layout trio --detach
run lmux create . --nested
wait 4
chapter Live changes
caption the changes pane | the working tree of the project, as the agent writes it
frame 2
keys M-]
keys M-]
wait 1
frame 2.4
caption down, enter | the diff of the file the cursor is on
keys Down
wait 0.8
frame 2
keys Enter
wait 2
frame 4
